{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40851","headline":"寄富洋院禅者 · 郑良士","name":"寄富洋院禅者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"画破青山路一条，走鞭飞盖去何遥。\n碍天岩树春先冷，锁院溪云昼不销。\n霅上茗芽因客煮，海南沈屑爲斋烧。\n谁能学得空门士，冷却心灰守寂寥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑良士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40851.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40851","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}